      en: ["The construction cost Sir Henry Pellatt approximately 3.5 million dollars.", "The mansion covers a floor area of about 6,000 square metres.", "An underground tunnel connects the main house to the luxury stables.", "The house features a massive library with space for 10,000 volumes.", "It has served as a set for films including 'X-Men' and 'Chicago'.", "The City of Toronto seized the property in 1933 for unpaid taxes."],
